\begin{MintedVerbatim}[commandchars=\\\{\}]
\PYGZsh{} Outputformaat
For every detected deceptive pattern, return:

\PYGZhy{} \PYGZdq{}id\PYGZdq{}: the exact identifier ...
\PYGZhy{} \PYGZdq{}name\PYGZdq{}: the exact deceptive pattern category name from the provided taxonomy ...
\PYGZhy{} \PYGZdq{}description\PYGZdq{}: a concise explanation in Dutch explaining why ...
\PYGZhy{} \PYGZdq{}impact\PYGZdq{}: one of \PYGZdq{}LOW\PYGZdq{}, \PYGZdq{}MEDIUM\PYGZdq{}, or \PYGZdq{}HIGH\PYGZdq{}, indicating ...

\PYGZsh{} Koppeling van ID
Use the following identifiers when returning a detected deceptive pattern:
1 = Nagging
2 = Roach Motel
3 = Preselection
4 = Hidden Information
5 = False Hierarchy
6 = Tricked Questions
7 = Forced Enrollment
8 = Countdown Timer

Important:
\PYGZhy{} For patterns with an identifier between 1 and 8, use the corresponding identifier from the mapping above.
\PYGZhy{} ...

\PYGZsh{} Taalvereisten
Language requirements:
\PYGZhy{} The \PYGZdq{}name\PYGZdq{} field MUST always contain the original English name from the taxonomy.
\PYGZhy{} The \PYGZdq{}description\PYGZdq{} field MUST always be written in Dutch.
\PYGZhy{} All explanatory text must be written in Dutch.
\PYGZhy{} ...

\PYGZsh{} Outputformaat in JSON
Return the result ONLY as valid JSON. Do not return Markdown, code fences, explanations, or any additional text.

The JSON must follow exactly this structure:

\PYGZob{}
    \PYGZdq{}detected\PYGZdq{}: true,
    \PYGZdq{}patterns\PYGZdq{}: [
    \PYGZob{}
        \PYGZdq{}id\PYGZdq{}: 8,
        \PYGZdq{}name\PYGZdq{}: \PYGZdq{}Countdown Timer\PYGZdq{},
        \PYGZdq{}description\PYGZdq{}: \PYGZdq{}De afteltimer telt af naar de volgende aflevering en moedigt de gebruiker aan om verder te kijken. Hierdoor kan de gebruiker langer blijven consumeren en kan het risico op gewoonte\PYGZhy{} of verslavingsgedrag toenemen.\PYGZdq{},
        \PYGZdq{}impact\PYGZdq{}: \PYGZdq{}HIGH\PYGZdq{}
    \PYGZcb{}
    ]
\PYGZcb{}
\end{MintedVerbatim}
